      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. The original test verifies that:\n1. `setScalable(true)` returns the same builder instance (fluent builder)\n2. The default `maxWidth` is `Integer.MAX_VALUE` (UNSET_MAX_WIDTH)\n\nLet me write an improved, more understandable version.The test compiled successfully. The improved test renames the method to `test_setScalable_returnsFluentBuilderAndMaxWidthDefaultsToUnset`, uses a clearer variable name (`returnedBuilder` instead of `textStyle_Builder1`), and adds inline comments explaining the intent of each assertion — while preserving the exact same method calls and expected outcomes as the original."
